<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0019266> rdfs:label "SAPHO syndrome"@en ;
    dcterms:description "SAPHO syndrome (acronym for Synovitis, Acne, Pustulosis, Hyperostosis and Osteitis) is an auto-inflammatory disease, mainly characterized by the association of neutrophilic cutaneous involvement and chronic osteomyelitis."@en ;
